{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HAB","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"哈巴谷書","commonName":"哈巴谷書","title":"哈巴谷書","order":35,"numberOfChapters":3,"sha256":"3950aea0497fecb9919bc35f98267a809e40b7449cd14053bf8d5ff0dbd8ea3b","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HAB/1.json","lastChapterNumber":3,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HAB/3.json","totalNumberOfVerses":56},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["哈巴谷的禱告"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["以下是哈巴谷先知的禱告，採用流離調",{"noteId":3},"。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"耶和華啊，我聽過你的威名；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華啊，我對你的作為充滿敬畏。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你如今再次彰顯你的作為，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你此時再次顯明你的作為，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你發怒的時候仍以憐憫為念。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"text":"上帝從提幔來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"聖者從巴蘭山來。（細拉）","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂的榮耀遮蔽諸天，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"頌讚之聲響徹大地。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂明亮如晨光，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂的手射出光芒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"其中蘊藏著大能。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"瘟疫行在祂前面，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"災病跟在祂腳後。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂停下，大地就震動；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂觀看，萬民就戰慄。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"古老的山嶽崩裂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"遠古的丘陵塌陷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但祂的作為永遠不變。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我看見古珊的帳篷遭難，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"米甸的幔子顫抖。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華啊，你是向江河發怒嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你騎著馬、乘著得勝的戰車而來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是向江河生氣嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是向海洋發怒嗎？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你張弓搭箭，要射出許多箭羽。（細拉）","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你以江河分開大地。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"群山看見你就戰慄，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大水奔騰而過，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"深淵鳴響，波浪滔天。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你射出的箭閃閃發光，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的槍熠熠生輝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以致日月都停在原處。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你懷著烈怒走遍大地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"帶著怒火踐踏列國。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你出來是為了拯救你的子民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"拯救你膏立的王。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你打垮邪惡之人的首領，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從頭到腳徹底毀滅他。（細拉）","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你用他的矛刺透其勇士的頭顱。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們如旋風而至，要驅散我們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們喜好暗中吞噬貧民。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你騎馬踩踏洶湧的大海。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我聽到這些，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就膽戰心驚，嘴唇哆嗦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"四肢無力，雙腿發抖。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但我仍要靜候災難臨到入侵者的日子。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"text":"即使無花果樹不發芽，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"葡萄樹不結果，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"橄欖樹無收成，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"田地不產糧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"圈裡沒有羊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"棚裡沒有牛，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我仍要因耶和華而歡欣，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因拯救我的上帝而喜樂。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主耶和華是我的力量，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂使我的腳如母鹿的蹄，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"穩行在高處。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這首歌交給樂長，用弦樂器伴奏。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":3,"caller":"+","text":"流離調是希伯來詩歌的一種曲調。","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":1}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HAB/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ZEP/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HAB/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":19}